## Context
Ticket 1090 found 1084 saved no turns: close-and-clean covers steps 7, 9a and 10, but step 9b (fetch, ancestry, bundle read-back, main sync and read-back) stayed as prose the model runs command by command, and `ExitWorktree remove` is refused once per exit even with main synced (1097, reopened). The exit tail from preflight to the end took 7-21 tool calls (median 10, n=4).

## Design (author: "only reasonable safety checks")
- `--phase exit-check [--bundle-branch B]`: preflight (clean tree), bounded fetch of the integration ref, HEAD ancestry or the bundle exception (B is the current `roar-*` branch, the remote tip equals HEAD, its merge request is open with auto-merge armed), main checkout on the default branch, `sync-local-main.sh`, main read-back. One verdict: `EXIT: READY` or `EXIT: KEEP-PENDING <reason>`, plus the `after-exit` command to run.
- The model then cds to the main checkout (no runtime worktree tool, ticket 1077), and runs `after-exit --remove-worktree PATH`: unlock and `git worktree remove` (Git refuses a dirty tree; never the main checkout or the cwd), then the scoped branch cleanup.
- Ownership stays the model's: it passes `--bundle-branch` and `--remove-worktree` only for trees and branches this task owns.

## Author decisions (2026-10-14, after gaze round 1 ESCALATE)
- The main-checkout-on-default-branch check and the main read-back are not gates. A parked or lagging main only makes `branch -d` keep the branch, a reported finding; exit-check notes it and stays READY.
- Ignored files: `git worktree remove` deletes them, as old step 9c did. Fix the SKILL.md wording only; the scan stays with ticket 1095 (report-only).

## Exit criteria
- [x] `exit-check` phase with the checks above; exit 0 READY, 1 KEEP-PENDING findings, 2 could-not-look
- [x] `after-exit --remove-worktree PATH` removes an owned, clean linked worktree; refuses the main checkout, the cwd, a dirty tree
- [x] SKILL.md steps 9a-9c rewritten around exit-check → cd → after-exit
- [x] Behavioural tests: merged READY, unmerged KEEP-PENDING, bundle armed READY, bundle not armed KEEP-PENDING, primary on another branch, dirty tree, fetch failure could-not-look, worktree removal and its refusals
- [x] `tests/test_roar_close_and_clean.sh` and `make check` pass
